{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Splice Mythic Beasts. Conquer the Circuit. Bet and Win.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chimera Circuit is a pixel-art tactical racing simulator set in a dark fantasy world inspired by 90s ASCII aesthetics. Splice two Chimeras together using over 100 unique chimeras from 10 Clades, each with distinct skills, as options. From EQUINE to SPECTRAL to UMA there is bound to be a Clade that resonates with you. Choose from four racer types\u2014Front Runner, Stalker, Mid Pack, or Closer\u2014to define your strategy. Creativity is rewarded with a total number of combinations reaching past 1,000,000, between game effects and visual style. Unlock new species through career racing, bet on outcomes, and dominate the track to build your legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through a 12-month career, selecting runes after each race\u2014some grant advantages, others impose penalties, adding rogue-like tension with limited lives. Shop for items, train stats, and splice retired chimeras from your pasture to create superior hybrids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025760/extras/d8d979f6552546e313d533c49596de00.poster.avif?t=1759450080\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025760/extras/d8d979f6552546e313d533c49596de00.webm?t=1759450080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025760/extras/d8d979f6552546e313d533c49596de00.mp4?t=1759450080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025760/extras/8795e4cd91df145118b6952c0a6e943b.poster.avif?t=1759450080\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025760/extras/8795e4cd91df145118b6952c0a6e943b.webm?t=1759450080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025760/extras/8795e4cd91df145118b6952c0a6e943b.mp4?t=1759450080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Splicing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge chimeras by selecting parents from your unlocked codex or pasture. Genetics pull from grandparents: father's father determines the model, mother's mother sets the palette, grandmothers provide traits, and grandfathers define Clades. Basic splices yield G1 hybrids; But we can go further beyond. Save top performers to your pasture for future splicing, expanding your genetic arsenal. Try splicing two of the same Chimera, young Splicer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025760/extras/686e14446cf040b8b5da02181e614cee.poster.avif?t=1759450080\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025760/extras/686e14446cf040b8b5da02181e614cee.webm?t=1759450080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025760/extras/686e14446cf040b8b5da02181e614cee.mp4?t=1759450080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intermission (Shop / Training / Betting)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between races, manage your chimera during intermissions. Visit the shop to purchase items like syringes for extra training actions or bandages to heal injuries. Train to boost stats\u2014SPD for velocity, STM for stamina regen, POW for collisions, TEC for terrain handling, WIL for resistance, POT for growth. Review racer stats and bet on favorites or win-place-show outcomes before selecting a track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025760/extras/d778df9e9a023fe416a1e7c362deacab.poster.avif?t=1759450080\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025760/extras/d778df9e9a023fe416a1e7c362deacab.webm?t=1759450080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025760/extras/d778df9e9a023fe416a1e7c362deacab.mp4?t=1759450080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025760/extras/4b69a1e9e54e9b9c6c4cc004280cad4c.poster.avif?t=1759450080\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025760/extras/4b69a1e9e54e9b9c6c4cc004280cad4c.webm?t=1759450080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025760/extras/4b69a1e9e54e9b9c6c4cc004280cad4c.mp4?t=1759450080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Racing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete on dynamic tracks with varied terrain, weather, and times of day. Position updates in real-time on a grid-based course, with ranks shifting as chimeras overtake. Activate clade skills using stamina orbs\u2014timing is critical for buffs, debuffs, or positioning. Finish first to earn dust (the currency of this world), trainings, and unlocks, advancing your career toward mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025760/extras/5e37b01c36066ae1cefc6486b25c8d90.poster.avif?t=1759450080\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025760/extras/5e37b01c36066ae1cefc6486b25c8d90.webm?t=1759450080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025760/extras/5e37b01c36066ae1cefc6486b25c8d90.mp4?t=1759450080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025760/extras/af8f980b8264818df6b942748acc26da.poster.avif?t=1759450080\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025760/extras/af8f980b8264818df6b942748acc26da.webm?t=1759450080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025760/extras/af8f980b8264818df6b942748acc26da.mp4?t=1759450080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Filters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025760/extras/8fe0a31b465bc84b1c276cf11ce1486f.poster.avif?t=1759450080\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025760/extras/8fe0a31b465bc84b1c276cf11ce1486f.webm?t=1759450080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025760/extras/8fe0a31b465bc84b1c276cf11ce1486f.mp4?t=1759450080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"